  "scope": "Appearance only. Original resources, logical canvases, world scale, anchors, hard bases, collision, topology and save state are retained.",
  "notes": [
    "Masters are generated redraws; this exporter performs only lossless packaging, transparent cropping and alpha-aware resampling.",
    "Only the seven world aliases are overridden; UI icon-spore retains its original alias.",
    "Flower and bloom share the same master-to-canvas transform and painted stone-base registration.",
    "Arch complete pillar-foot reference points are registered to the existing canonical hard-base coordinates. GPU verification remains required.",
    "Spore uses one uniform scale, measured from the main gold sphere rather than its old white-rim/halo bounds; its original sphere diameter and centre are retained.",
    "Fractional alpha is preserved. Mipmaps are generated for all new world sprites; opaque prepass and depth testing remain unchanged."
  ],
